# EmailGuard placement-test poller. Runs every 5 min. Each tick:
#   1) lists all inbox-placement tests via the EmailGuard HTTP API
#   2) parses the name field for our AUTO|<shard>|<sender>|<ts> prefix
#   3) upserts the test header into dmarc... err public.emailguard_placement_tests
#   4) upserts each per-seed row into public.emailguard_placement_emails
*/5 * * * * /usr/local/bin/python /app/emailguard/poll.py
